<title>HONG KONG: China Foods posts sharp interim net rise.</title>
<headline>China Foods posts sharp interim net rise.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   2.0	 vs  0.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.04 loss vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    12.04     vs  3.34</p>
<p>    Turnover		     234.46    vs  363.86</p>
<p>    Company name		 China Foods Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Food processing concern China Foods Holdings is controlled by China National Cereals Oil and Foodstuffs Import and Export Corp (Ceroil).</p>
<p>It gave no details of the exceptional loss.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
